  "guidance": {
    "en": {
      "summary": "A hiatus hernia can contribute to heartburn and reflux. NHS: lifestyle measures and pharmacy/GP pathways similar to GORD; surgery is specialist. Emergency: sudden severe chest/abdominal pain, vomiting blood, black stools, or difficulty swallowing solids/liquids with weight loss — urgent assessment. Never invent PPI doses.",
