        "Vomiting blood or black stools",
        "Sudden severe chest/abdominal pain",
        "Food sticking with progressive swallowing difficulty"
      ],
      "seeDoctorIf": [
        "Persistent heartburn",
        "Known hiatus hernia with worsening reflux"
      ],
      "doNot": [
        "Do not invent PPI regimens",
        "Do not dismiss vomiting blood"
      ]
    },
    "fr": {
      "summary": "Hernie hiatale: reflux. Urgences si hématémèse, méléna, douleur brutale, dysphagie progressive. Pas de posologies inventées.",
